OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after battery causes bin
OL,4,Alorry fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters tackled a blaze in a bin
OL,7,Florry caused by an "improperly disposed
OL,8,Fbattery", Lincolnshire Fire and Rescue
OL,9,FService has said.
OL,11,FTwo fire engines attended the incident
OL,12,Fon Elvington Road in Lincoln at about
OL,13,F10:25 BST on Tuesday.
OL,15,FPhotographs and video footage show a
OL,16,Fpile of waste burning by the roadside.
OL,18,FLincolnshire County Council is warning
OL,19,Fof the dangers of putting batteries in
OL,20,Fwaste collections and said they should
OL,21,Fbe disposed of at recycling centres.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
